      "content": "wait really?? meningitis?? that sounds super scary. i dont know if i want to sit in an er for hours for something that might just be a bad migraine. i also noticed when i turn on the lights it kind of hurts my eyes a bit, but i've had that before with headaches. is it possible you're overreacting and i could just sleep it off with some extra tylenol?",
